00:40:54.680 --> 00:40:55.920
Ito ay...

00:40:56.560 --> 00:40:59.320
Yung sinira ng mga taga-nayon.

00:40:59.320 --> 00:41:00.400
Pribado?

00:41:37.880 --> 00:41:37.960
Pribadong pangalawang klase na Yang

00:41:50.760 --> 00:41:51.760
Hoy.

